# W5 acceptance row 1 (docs/w5-gates.md section 2): Art-Net output beside sACN. Run in the W5Acc scratch library made by
# `python -I tools/ref/w5_wire.py prep <userdir>`, with the userdir as the working directory and
# `w5_wire.py node 50 --answer 20` started just before (docs/w5-integration.md "Acceptance" row 1).
open hardware_setup
assert_text THardwareSetupForm2.cbProto2 "sACN"
assert_text THardwareSetupForm2.seArtAddr2 "2"
click THardwareSetupForm2.cbProto2
key Down
key Enter
assert_text THardwareSetupForm2.cbProto2 "Art-Net"
click THardwareSetupForm2.bOk
assert_file_line Hardware.Ini "Proto2=1"
assert_file_line Hardware.Ini "Addr2=2"
cl_load CueLists/00000003.Cl2
cl_execute
wait 1500
open hardware_setup
wait 1100
shot ../w5shots/artnet-fading.png
close hardware_setup
wait 2500
assert_frame 1:1=255
assert_frame 2:1=255
wait 6000
open hardware_setup
wait 1100
shot ../w5shots/artnet-idle.png
close hardware_setup
wait 17000
open hardware_setup
wait 1100
shot ../w5shots/artnet-nonode.png
close hardware_setup
quit
